{
  "about": "Tool-call correctness eval (technical design): 26 scripted Kitchen Copilot questions with the expected first tool call. Run against the default mock data (generateMockData(), today = its last day) as a user of `outlet`. `expected.args` is a subset: every listed key must match, other keys are ignored; outlet_id is never listed. \"{item:<menu name>}\" stands for that item's id in the outlet's menu. `tool: null` means the right first move is no tool call. `history`, when given, is the earlier chat (user/assistant pairs) sent before `message`. See ADR 0015.",
  "outlet": "Warung Rina",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "waste-total-yesterday",
      "area": "waste_total",
      "message": "Berapa total limbah kemarin?",
      "language": "id",
      "role": "manager",
      "today": "2026-04-01",
      "expected": {
        "tool": "query_waste",
        "args": { "filters": { "from": "2026-03-31", "to": "2026-03-31" }, "group_by": "none" }
      }
    },
    {
